#: maxframe.liteframe.missing.check.notna:3 of
msgid ""
"Returns a boolean LiteFrame of the same shape where each cell is ``True``"
" where the corresponding value is not null (NA) and ``False`` where it is"
" null."
msgstr ""
"返回相同形状的布尔型 LiteFrame，其中每个单元格在对应值不为 null (NA) 时为"
" ``True``，在为 null 时为 ``False``。"

